}
text GogoatRaceRulesText2{
    "The rules are simple: you'll do your\n"
    "best to navigate through a forest\l"
    "to a clearing with a flag.\p"
    "Grab that flag, then bring it back\n"
    "to the starting line. That's all.\p"
    "The current fastest time is\n"
    "{STR_VAR_2} seconds."
}

text GogoatRaceIntro{
    "Howdy partner!\p"
    "Are you here to take part in our\n"
    "world-famous Gogoat racing?\p"
    "It's real simple: We'll lend you one\n"
    "of our Gogoats and set up a bunch of\l"
    "flags around the farm.\p"
    "All you need to do is grab all the\n"
    "flags and then return them to me.\p"
    "Sounds real simple, eh?\p"
    "Well, our Gogoats are renowned for\n"
    "their speed, so it can be real hard\l"
    "to control them!\p"
    "If you can beat the current record\n"
    "holder, we'll even give you a prize!\l"
    "The current record is {STR_VAR_2} seconds."
}
text WannaGogoatRace{
    "Up for some Gogoat racing?"
}
text LetsGetGogoatRacing{
    "Alright!\n"
    "Let's Gogoat!"
}
